# CodePush deployment for Android

# To get your deployment keys:
# 1. Install App Center CLI: npm install -g appcenter-cli
# 2. Login: appcenter login
# 3. Create your app: appcenter apps create -d "YourApp-Android" -o Android -p React-Native
# 4. Create deployments:
#    appcenter codepush deployment add Staging -a your-username/YourApp-Android
#    appcenter codepush deployment add Production -a your-username/YourApp-Android
# 5. List keys: appcenter codepush deployment list -a your-username/YourApp-Android -k
